|-------------------|----------|------------|---------------------|----------|----------|-------------|------------|-------|
|                   | # 1raiii |            |                     | WebQA    | HotpotQA | Performance | Resilience | Boost |
| xRAG (Mistral-7b) | 955k     | 39.10      | 65.77               | 39.40    | 34.05    | 44.58       | 82.3%      | 22.2% |
| w RC only         | 488k     | 36.98      | 65.77               | 41.39    | 32.82    | 44.24       | 81.9%      | 22.4% |
