|            | w E5-Mistral  | 7B   | 4096                          | ✓         | 66.63 | 44.0        | 84.0%      | 20.6% |
|            | w E5-Large    | 335M | 1024                          | ✓         | 62.25 | 42.1        | 80.2%      | 19.6% |
